<!-- WHAT'S NEW IN 2026 -->
<section style="background:#f5f8f9;">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-label">What's New</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">GYCT 2026: Evolving For Impact</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">After three years and 5,400+ participants, we're evolving from a single introductory model into a multi-layered ecosystem — responding directly to what our global alumni community has asked for.</p>

    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon"><i class="fas fa-seedling"></i></div>
        <h3>General Cohort</h3>
        <p><strong style="color:#003b4a;">500 participants</strong> from MAPA and global regions. Expanded curriculum beyond climate science to include geopolitics, climate enforcement, and system change — because climate decisions aren't made in a vacuum.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;color:#557580;">Topics: Non-state climate action · COP roles · Climate geopolitics · System change · Climate risk · Education</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="border-color:#f15a27;border-width:2px;">
        <div class="card-icon"><i class="fas fa-star"></i></div>
        <h3>Advanced YNA Cohort <span style="background:#f15a27;color:#fff;font-size:10px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;margin-left:6px;">NEW</span></h3>
        <p><strong style="color:#003b4a;">20 selected participants</strong> partner with the Youth Negotiators Academy (YNA) for hands-on COP simulations, personalised guidance, and direct mentorship from experienced negotiators.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;color:#557580;">Objective: practical COP negotiation skills and strategic influence — not just theory.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-icon"><i class="fas fa-rocket"></i></div>
        <h3>Future Pathways</h3>
        <p>Looking beyond 2026: project-based learning, fellowships, practical internships, alumni mentorship — turning training into tangible career pathways for youth climate leaders.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

